The Feishu connector runs the official @larksuite/cli binary (MIT License, Lark Technologies).

src/connectors/google/gmail-spec.ts contains tool and field descriptions copied from Google's Gmail MCP reference
(https://developers.google.com/workspace/gmail/api/reference/mcp), Google Developers documentation licensed under
the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 License (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

Gmail bodies are converted with html-to-text (MIT License) and drafts are composed with nodemailer (MIT-0 License).

guides/google-gmail.md adapts the agent skills gws-shared, gws-gmail and gws-gmail-* of the Google Workspace CLI
(https://github.com/googleworkspace/cli, v0.22.5, Apache License 2.0). The connector runs that CLI's official
release binary when one is configured; the binary is not bundled in this package.
